{
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization and algebraic adaptation of the equivalence between the planar Jacobian conjecture and the four-variable Hessian conjecture. Over every algebraically closed field of characteristic zero, the two polynomial-inverse conjectures are equivalent. Over arbitrary characteristic-zero fields, the corresponding same-field injectivity statements are equivalent with determinant-one normalization on the Hessian side. Neither conjecture is proved unconditionally.",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Jamie Little"
    }
  ],
